{"id":"minimalist-landing","title":"Minimalist — SaaS Landing","description":"A calm, content-first landing page with generous whitespace, one accent color and quiet scroll reveals. The reference starting point for SaaS, portfolio and productivity products.","tags":["minimalist","saas","landing-page"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T18:25:55.297Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Minimalist — SaaS Landing\ndescription: A calm, content-first landing page with generous whitespace, one accent color and quiet scroll reveals. The reference starting point for SaaS, portfolio and productivity products.\ntags: [minimalist, saas, landing-page]\norder: 1\n---\n\n# Minimalist — SaaS Landing\n\nThe \"less is more\" reference: one column of content, a single ink color, hairline dividers and no decoration that doesn't carry meaning.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Background | `#fdfdfc` warm white |\n| Ink / accent | `#141414` (buttons are ink-colored) |\n| Secondary | `#8a8a8a` |\n| Border | `#e8e8e6` 1px hairlines |\n| Type | system sans, tight headline (-0.03em), 17px body |\n\n## Layout\n\nSticky-free simple flow: nav → hero (eyebrow, headline, email capture) → 3 numbered features with rule-topped columns → oversized quote → minimal footer.\n\n## Motion\n\nQuiet reveal-on-scroll (opacity + 14px rise, IntersectionObserver, tiny stagger). Nothing else moves — restraint is the style.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Minimalist — SaaS Landing\n\nThe \"less is more\" reference: one column of content, a single ink color, hairline dividers and no decoration that doesn't carry meaning.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Background | `#fdfdfc` warm white |\n| Ink / accent | `#141414` (buttons are ink-colored) |\n| Secondary | `#8a8a8a` |\n| Border | `#e8e8e6` 1px hairlines |\n| Type | system sans, tight headline (-0.03em), 17px body |\n\n## Layout\n\nSticky-free simple flow: nav → hero (eyebrow, headline, email capture) → 3 numbered features with rule-topped columns → oversized quote → minimal footer.\n\n## Motion\n\nQuiet reveal-on-scroll (opacity + 14px rise, IntersectionObserver, tiny stagger). Nothing else moves — restraint is the style.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>Focus — Minimalist SaaS\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  :root { --ink: #141414; --mut: #8a8a8a; --line: #e8e8e6; --bg: #fdfdfc; }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }\n  .wrap { max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }\n  nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 22px 0; }\n  .logo { font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }\n  .logo span { color: var(--mut); }\n  .links { display: flex; gap: 26px; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--mut); }\n  .links a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }\n  .links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }\n  .btn { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; border: 0; cursor: pointer; font: inherit; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 8px; }\n  header { padding: 110px 0 90px; }\n  .eyebrow { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mut); margin-bottom: 18px; }\n  h1 { font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 58px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 750; }\n  h1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--mut); }\n  .sub { margin: 22px 0 34px; font-size: 17px; color: var(--mut); max-width: 480px; }\n  .signup { display: flex; gap: 10px; max-width: 420px; }\n  .signup input { flex: 1; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; outline: none; }\n  .signup input:focus { border-color: #bbb; }\n  .note { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--mut); }\n  section { padding: 70px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  .feat { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 38px; }\n  .feat .n { font-size: 12px; color: var(--mut); border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 12px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .feat h3 { font-size: 15px; margin: 14px 0 8px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n  .feat p { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--mut); }\n  blockquote { font-size: clamp(22px, 3.4vw, 30px); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 600; }\n  .who { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--mut); }\n  footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  footer .wrap { padding: 26px 24px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--mut); }\n  @media (max-width: 700px) { .feat { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .links { display: none; } }\n  .rv { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px); transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease; }\n  .rv.on { opacity: 1; transform: none; }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cnav>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"logo\">focus\u003cspan>.\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"links\">\u003ca href=\"#\">Product\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Pricing\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Docs\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Blog\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"btn\">Get started\u003c/button>\n    \u003c/nav>\n\n    \u003cheader>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"eyebrow rv\">Note-taking for makers\u003c/div>\n      \u003ch1 class=\"rv\">Clear notes,\u003cbr>\u003cem>clearer thinking.\u003c/em>\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cp class=\"sub rv\">A calm workspace that gets out of your way. Capture ideas in seconds and find them again in one keystroke.\u003c/p>\n      \u003cform class=\"signup rv\" id=\"form\">\n        \u003cinput type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@work.com\" required>\n        \u003cbutton class=\"btn\">Start free\u003c/button>\n      \u003c/form>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"note rv\">Free 14-day trial · No credit card required\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/header>\n\n    \u003csection>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"feat\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"rv\">\u003cdiv class=\"n\">01\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Instant capture\u003c/h3>\u003cp>A global hotkey opens a quick note from anywhere, so nothing ever breaks your flow.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"rv\">\u003cdiv class=\"n\">02\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Effortless order\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Notes link to each other and organise themselves as your thinking grows.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"rv\">\u003cdiv class=\"n\">03\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Private by default\u003c/h3>\u003cp>End-to-end encrypted. Your notes are yours — export everything, anytime.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/section>\n\n    \u003csection>\n      \u003cblockquote class=\"rv\">“The first notes app that feels quieter than my own head. I open it twenty times a day and it never asks for attention.”\u003c/blockquote>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"who rv\">— A product designer in Kuala Lumpur\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/section>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cfooter>\u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\u003cspan>© 2026 Focus\u003c/span>\u003cspan>Made with restraint\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003c/footer>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver(es => es.forEach(e => e.isIntersecting && e.target.classList.add('on')), { threshold: 0.15 });\n    document.querySelectorAll('.rv').forEach((el, i) => { el.style.transitionDelay = (i % 4) * 60 + 'ms'; io.observe(el); });\n    document.getElementById('form').addEventListener('submit', e => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const b = e.target.querySelector('button');\n      b.textContent = 'Check your inbox ✓';\n      b.disabled = true;\n    });\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>Focus — Minimalist SaaS\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  :root { --ink: #141414; --mut: #8a8a8a; --line: #e8e8e6; --bg: #fdfdfc; }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }\n  .wrap { max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }\n  nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 22px 0; }\n  .logo { font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }\n  .logo span { color: var(--mut); }\n  .links { display: flex; gap: 26px; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--mut); }\n  .links a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }\n  .links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }\n  .btn { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; border: 0; cursor: pointer; font: inherit; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 8px; }\n  header { padding: 110px 0 90px; }\n  .eyebrow { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mut); margin-bottom: 18px; }\n  h1 { font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 58px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 750; }\n  h1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--mut); }\n  .sub { margin: 22px 0 34px; font-size: 17px; color: var(--mut); max-width: 480px; }\n  .signup { display: flex; gap: 10px; max-width: 420px; }\n  .signup input { flex: 1; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; outline: none; }\n  .signup input:focus { border-color: #bbb; }\n  .note { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--mut); }\n  section { padding: 70px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  .feat { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 38px; }\n  .feat .n { font-size: 12px; color: var(--mut); border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 12px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .feat h3 { font-size: 15px; margin: 14px 0 8px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n  .feat p { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--mut); }\n  blockquote { font-size: clamp(22px, 3.4vw, 30px); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 600; }\n  .who { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--mut); }\n  footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  footer .wrap { padding: 26px 24px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--mut); }\n  @media (max-width: 700px) { .feat { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .links { display: none; } }\n  .rv { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px); transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease; }\n  .rv.on { opacity: 1; transform: none; }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cnav>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"logo\">focus\u003cspan>.\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"links\">\u003ca href=\"#\">Product\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Pricing\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Docs\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Blog\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"btn\">Get started\u003c/button>\n    \u003c/nav>\n\n    \u003cheader>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"eyebrow rv\">Note-taking for makers\u003c/div>\n      \u003ch1 class=\"rv\">Clear notes,\u003cbr>\u003cem>clearer thinking.\u003c/em>\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cp class=\"sub rv\">A calm workspace that gets out of your way. Capture ideas in seconds and find them again in one keystroke.\u003c/p>\n      \u003cform class=\"signup rv\" id=\"form\">\n        \u003cinput type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@work.com\" required>\n        \u003cbutton class=\"btn\">Start free\u003c/button>\n      \u003c/form>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"note rv\">Free 14-day trial · No credit card required\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/header>\n\n    \u003csection>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"feat\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"rv\">\u003cdiv class=\"n\">01\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Instant capture\u003c/h3>\u003cp>A global hotkey opens a quick note from anywhere, so nothing ever breaks your flow.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"rv\">\u003cdiv class=\"n\">02\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Effortless order\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Notes link to each other and organise themselves as your thinking grows.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"rv\">\u003cdiv class=\"n\">03\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Private by default\u003c/h3>\u003cp>End-to-end encrypted. Your notes are yours — export everything, anytime.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/section>\n\n    \u003csection>\n      \u003cblockquote class=\"rv\">“The first notes app that feels quieter than my own head. I open it twenty times a day and it never asks for attention.”\u003c/blockquote>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"who rv\">— A product designer in Kuala Lumpur\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/section>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cfooter>\u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\u003cspan>© 2026 Focus\u003c/span>\u003cspan>Made with restraint\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003c/footer>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver(es => es.forEach(e => e.isIntersecting && e.target.classList.add('on')), { threshold: 0.15 });\n    document.querySelectorAll('.rv').forEach((el, i) => { el.style.transitionDelay = (i % 4) * 60 + 'ms'; io.observe(el); });\n    document.getElementById('form').addEventListener('submit', e => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const b = e.target.querySelector('button');\n      b.textContent = 'Check your inbox ✓';\n      b.disabled = true;\n    });\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}}